'PREMIUM','HARD',
'Why does the passage mention the Industrial Revolution?','{"A":"To explain when solar panels were invented","B":"To identify when human-caused climate change began to accelerate","C":"To praise the achievements of industry","D":"To describe when fossil fuels were discovered"}','{"value":"B"}','The Industrial Revolution marks when large-scale burning of fossil fuels began, accelerating climate change.','PUBLISHED',NOW(),NULL),
